700
00:36:43,240 --> 00:36:48,640
Or objectively, bad for
me, for these things, to--

701
00:36:48,640 --> 00:36:51,465
the pipes in my factory to be
ripped out or what have you.

702
00:36:55,450 --> 00:36:59,200
Here is a sort of combined
technical and philosophical

703
00:36:59,200 --> 00:37:02,970
problem, though, which is that--

704
00:37:02,970 --> 00:37:05,970
unlike the intended
meaning of my instructions

705
00:37:05,970 --> 00:37:09,690
or my revealed
preferences, what's

706
00:37:09,690 --> 00:37:12,660
objectively good for me
is not something that

707
00:37:12,660 --> 00:37:14,990
can be determined empirically.

708
00:37:14,990 --> 00:37:18,930
This is a philosophical
question, not a scientific one.

709
00:37:18,930 --> 00:37:21,330
So it's not just a
matter of building

710
00:37:21,330 --> 00:37:23,100
the right model
of human language

711
00:37:23,100 --> 00:37:26,450
or observing the user enough.

712
00:37:26,450 --> 00:37:30,090
To figure out what's
actually in my best interest

713
00:37:30,090 --> 00:37:32,600
is not entirely an
empirical endeavor.

714
00:37:32,600 --> 00:37:36,720
You've got to actually do some
substantive moral philosophy

715
00:37:36,720 --> 00:37:37,850
to solve this.

716
00:37:41,380 --> 00:37:44,500
Now, the bad news for
solving this problem

717
00:37:44,500 --> 00:37:47,770
is that there's a lot of
disagreement about what is

718
00:37:47,770 --> 00:37:50,410
objectively good for a person.

719
00:37:50,410 --> 00:37:52,190
I say philosophers
disagree about this,

720
00:37:52,190 --> 00:37:54,220
but I think
non-philosophers also

721
00:37:54,220 --> 00:37:56,987
disagree about this as well.

722
00:37:56,987 --> 00:38:02,170
Is it just a person's own
pleasure or happiness that's

723
00:38:02,170 --> 00:38:06,400
good for them, or is
it the satisfaction

724
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:08,710
of that person's
desires or preferences

725
00:38:08,710 --> 00:38:12,080
that could be different
from pleasure or happiness?

726
00:38:12,080 --> 00:38:16,570
I might have preferences that
will be satisfied only after I'm

727
00:38:16,570 --> 00:38:17,660
dead or something.

728
00:38:17,660 --> 00:38:20,060
I'll never derive any pleasure
from their satisfaction,

729
00:38:20,060 --> 00:38:23,470
although they could
still be satisfied.

730
00:38:23,470 --> 00:38:28,100
Or do we want to say that
