even if we don't enjoy them,

733
00:38:34,750 --> 00:38:36,250
don't prefer them?

734
00:38:36,250 --> 00:38:41,130
These are all sort of live
options in the theory of value.

735
00:38:41,130 --> 00:38:43,110
And depending on how you
answer this question,

736
00:38:43,110 --> 00:38:47,150
you're going to be looking
at a different kind of value,

737
00:38:47,150 --> 00:38:49,711
even if you already know
that what you want to do

738
00:38:49,711 --> 00:38:51,753
is aligned to what's in
the user's best interest.

739
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:57,450
The good news, though, is
that behind this disagreement,

740
00:38:57,450 --> 00:39:04,440
there is quite a lot of
agreement, I would say.

741
00:39:04,440 --> 00:39:09,250
These things like health,
safety, liberty, knowledge,

742
00:39:09,250 --> 00:39:11,958
