almost everyone

743
00:39:11,958 --> 00:39:13,500
agrees that these
things are at least

744
00:39:13,500 --> 00:39:16,300
usually good for the
person who has them.

745
00:39:16,300 --> 00:39:20,460
Even if you think that really,
ultimately, all that matters,

746
00:39:20,460 --> 00:39:22,710
all that's good for a person
is their own happiness,

747
00:39:22,710 --> 00:39:26,260
well, these things
typically make

748
00:39:26,260 --> 00:39:28,270
the person who has them happy.

749
00:39:28,270 --> 00:39:31,330
So you might think
you don't really

750
00:39:31,330 --> 00:39:36,520
need to resolve this underlying
philosophical dispute to have

751
00:39:36,520 --> 00:39:38,680
a good sense of what's in
